fixture cam_double_jump_in_place
doc camera review (docs/adr/0011): a full jump with a full air jump at the apex, in place on flat ground (BUILD.md s5: "jumps never bob it")
room test/camera
spawn 1600 3200
frames 150
input
  0..28 jump
  29 jump !jump
  30..60 jump
end
expect
  at 0 event.jump=1
  at 29 event.air_jump=1
  mark land 30..149 event.land=1
  at land y=3200u
end
